+# Billing disputes
+
+Billing questions are classified by `classifyBillingQuestion` in `/src/billing.ts` and routed to human review.
+
+- A message containing `refund` is classified as `refund-review`.
+- Other billing questions, including invoice questions, are classified as `invoice-question`.
+
+These classifications do not approve a refund or change an invoice.

